# StarWall logo

The only StarWall mark is `public/SW3.png` (chrome oval badge supplied by AGRON). Use this file for the header, footer, login shell, favicon, Open Graph, connections map, and proposal PDFs.

- Do not redraw the wordmark in CSS or SVG.
- Do not generate a replacement logo.
- Do not switch to another asset, even if it looks similar.
- Keep the path `/SW3.png` so every surface stays on the same file.
